OL,3,ASeventh man bailed in connection with
OL,4,ARAF Fairford incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn total, seven men - all in their 20s
OL,7,F- have been arrested in connection with
OL,8,Fthe incident but no one has been
OL,9,Fcharged.
